msgctxt "'dir_dir_FORM_TITLE"
msgid ""
"Placeholder for missing original text - this means that \t\t\t\t\tthere was "
"a string in the translated lex file which did not appear in the english base"
" file.\t\t\t\t\tProbably due to it no longer being required."
msgstr "改变LDAP目录设置"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_LABEL_ROOT"
msgid "Server root"
msgstr "Server root"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DESCRIPTION"
msgid ""
"The LDAP server provides a network-available listing of the user accounts \n"
"and groups on your server, and can be accessed using an LDAP client such as the Address Book feature\n"
" in Netscape Communicator. Configure your LDAP client with the local IP address of your server, \n"
" port number 389, and the server root parameter shown below."
msgstr ""
"LDAP 服务器提供了在服务器上的用户帐户和群组的可用列表，并且可以通过使用一个LDAP客户端（如Netscape "
"Communicator的地址簿功能）来访问。使用服务器的本地IP，端口号389来设置LDAP客户端，服务器的根参数如下。"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DESC_DIRECTORY_ACCESS"
msgid ""
"You can control access to your LDAP directory: \n"
"the private setting allows access only from your local network, and the public setting allows access from anywhere on the Internet."
msgstr "您可以控制对LDAP目录的访问：“私有”设置只允许从本地网络访问，“公开”设置允许从互联网的任何地方访问。"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DIRECTORY_ACCESS"
msgid "LDAP directory access"
msgstr "LDAP 目录访问"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DESC_DEPARTMENT"
msgid ""
"These fields are the LDAP defaults for your organization.\n"
"Whenever you create a new user account, you will be prompted\n"
"to enter all of these fields (they can be different for each\n"
"user) but the values you set here\n"
"will show up as defaults. This is a convenience to make it\n"
"faster to create user accounts."
msgstr ""
"这些字段是LDAP的默认值。当您创建了一个新的用户账号，您将会被提示输入所有这些字段（每个用户可能不一样），但是在此处设置的值将会被视为默认值。这样可以方便快速地创建用户账号。"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DEPARTMENT"
msgid "Default department"
msgstr "默认的部门"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_COMPANY"
msgid "Default company"
msgstr "默认的公司"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_STREET"
msgid "Default Street address"
msgstr "默认的街道地址"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_CITY"
msgid "Default City"
msgstr "默认的城市"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_PHONENUMBER"
msgid "Default Phone Number"
msgstr "默认的电话号码"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_DESC_EXISTING"
msgid ""
"You can either leave existing user accounts as they are, using the above defaults only for\n"
"new users, or you can apply the above defaults to all existing users as well."
msgstr "您既可以让已存在的用户保持原样、让新用户使用上述默认值，也可以将上述默认值应用到所有已存在用户。"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_EXISTING"
msgid "Existing users"
msgstr "已存在的用户"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_SUCCESS"
msgid "The new LDAP default settings have been saved."
msgstr "LDAP 默认设置已被保存。"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_LEAVE"
msgid "Leave as they are"
msgstr "保持原样"

msgctxt "'dir_dir_UPDATE"
msgid "Update with new defaults"
msgstr "更新默认值"
